"""
FinanceJobs — collect remote/global finance jobs from legitimate job APIs.

WHY NOT LINKEDIN
----------------
LinkedIn has no job-search API available to an individual developer:
  * API auth is app-based (OAuth client id/secret), never email/password.
  * The only self-serve products are "Sign In with LinkedIn" (OIDC) and
    "Share on LinkedIn" — they return your own profile and let you post.
    Neither carries a job-search scope.
  * The Job Posting API is for ATS vendors pushing jobs INTO LinkedIn, and
    sits behind the Talent Solutions Partner Program (closed to new partners).
The unauthenticated /jobs-guest/ endpoint exists but rate-limits hard, exposes
few fields, and breaches LinkedIn's User Agreement. This script therefore uses
public job APIs that permit programmatic access.

USAGE
-----
    pip install httpx pandas

    python FinanceJobs              # collect + append to CSV
    python FinanceJobs --probe      # dump raw API shapes (diagnose schema drift)
    python FinanceJobs --self-test  # offline checks, no network

ENV (all optional)
------------------
    JOBS_OUTPUT_CSV   output path      (default: ./finance_jobs.csv)
    JOBS_CONTACT      contact in UA    (default: none)
    ADZUNA_APP_ID / ADZUNA_APP_KEY     enables Adzuna
    RAPIDAPI_KEY                       enables JSearch
"""

